  {
   "id": "max485",
   "name": "RS485 transceiver (MAX485)",
   "description": "Serial over long twisted wires (up to 1200 m), many devices on one pair. Board side: DI (the board's TX), RO (its RX), DE (HIGH: send) and RE (LOW: receive), usually tied together on one pin. Line side: A to A, B to B on every module (swapped, the bytes come out garbled). Use Serial1 / Serial2 / SoftwareSerial at the same baud on every node; set DE/RE HIGH just while sending.",
